-- Zul'Gurub in four difficulties, as Molten Core (01_mc_difficulty_templates.sql): every combat
-- creature of map 309 and every add its encounters summon gets Heroic, Mythic and Ascended templates
-- at +100000, +200000 and +300000. The CoA client creature caches carry HealthModifier x1.44, x1.88
-- and x2.32 of Normal for the variants recorded (Hakkar, Mar'li, Arlokk, Bloodseeker Bat); melee
-- DamageModifier follows the same ladder as in rev_20261001_11_molten_core_melee_damage_ladder.sql.
-- Spawns keep the base id: the core picks the template of the instance difficulty. AI and script
-- always come from the base template, so the variants carry neither.
-- Critters, triggers, Zanza, Jin'do's and Hakkar's totems, clouds and the Heart keep one template.

-- 61 families, 183 new templates.

-- heroic
